[[File:MainBaseplate.png|600px|thumb|center]]

The {{Credits|Main Baseplate|symbol=no}} is a [[baseplate]] unlocked upon starting the game. It is the first progression baseplate that players will experience, preceding the [[Research Baseplate|&lt;span class="gradient" style="background:linear-gradient(#73d4fe,#5677ce)"&gt;'''Research Baseplate'''&lt;/span&gt;]]. Additionally, the [[Prestige Baseplate|&lt;span class="gradient" style="background:linear-gradient(#f8f099,#e69e26)"&gt;'''Prestige Baseplate'''&lt;/span&gt;]], the [[Bonus Baseplate|{{color|rgb(150, 255, 60)|Bonus Baseplate|black}}]] and the [[Donation Baseplate|{{Color|rgb(98, 255, 255)|Donation Baseplate|black}}]] also connect to the baseplate. Currently, the baseplate includes 28 total upgrades: 20 in layer 1 and 8 in layer 2.

== Credits ==

{{Credits|Credits|symbol=no}} ({{Credits}}) is the first Currency players unlock upon purchasing {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#1&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} at no cost. It generates at a base rate of {{Color|rgb(45, 150, 255)|1/s|black}}. Once bought, the upgrade shows your current {{Credits|credits gain|symbol=no}}.

[[File:Credits1.png|200px|thumb|center]]

