== Features ==
=== Boombox ===

[[File:Boombox.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Boombox]]''
The {{color|rgb(255, 255, 51)|Boombox|black}} is a feature located behind player's spawn that give players access to multiple soundpacks made by the staff team of Upgradex.



=== Cube ===

[[File:Cube.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube]]''
The &lt;span class="gradient" style="background:linear-gradient(#D2CDF0,#F0BEE6)"&gt;'''Cube'''&lt;/span&gt; is a feature unlocked by upgrade #CB. It can be clicked, providing boosts and milestones based on the current click amount.



=== Trampoline ===

[[File:Trampoline.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Trampoline]]
The {{Credits|Trampoline|symbol=no}} is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#2B&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It acts as a mean of travel that let the player jump to Bonus Baseplate. Another trampoline is located on Bonus Baseplate to go back to Main Baseplate.

=== Decorator ===

[[File:Decorator.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Decorator]]''
The {{color|rgb(255, 255, 51)|Decorator|black}} is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#3B&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It allows the player buy decorations on every baseplate.



=== Cube Teleporter ===
[[File:CubeTeleporter.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube Telepoter]]
The {{Credits|Cube teleporter|symbol=no}} is a feature unlocked by multiple upgrades. It allows the player to teleport to different zones of the game. This baseplates's Cube Teleporter teleport the player to the [[Donation Baseplate]]

[[Category:Baseplates]]
[[Category:Locations]]

{{Stub|Needs more formulas and Tags + Currency templates}} 
&lt;templatestyles src="Template:Hiddenpage/styles.css" /&gt;
&lt;span class="hidden-pageimage"&gt;[[File:Tp_spawn.png|300px|class=pageimage|link=|alt=]]&lt;/span&gt;

[[File:MainBaseplate.png|600px|thumb|center]]

The {{Credits|Main Baseplate|symbol=no}} is a [[baseplate]] unlocked upon starting the game. It is the first progression baseplate that players will experience, preceding the [[Research Baseplate|&lt;span class="gradient" style="background:linear-gradient(#73d4fe,#5677ce)"&gt;'''Research Baseplate'''&lt;/span&gt;]]. Additionally, the [[Prestige Baseplate|&lt;span class="gradient" style="background:linear-gradient(#f8f099,#e69e26)"&gt;'''Prestige Baseplate'''&lt;/span&gt;]], the [[Bonus Baseplate|{{color|rgb(150, 255, 60)|Bonus Baseplate|black}}]] and the [[Donation Baseplate|{{Color|rgb(98, 255, 255)|Donation Baseplate|black}}]] also connect to the baseplate. Currently, the baseplate includes 28 total upgrades: 20 in layer 1 and 8 in layer 2.

== Credits ==

{{Credits|Credits|symbol=no}} ({{Credits}}) is the first Currency players unlock upon purchasing {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#1&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} at no cost. It generates at a base rate of {{Color|rgb(45, 150, 255)|1/s|black}}. Once bought, the upgrade shows your current {{Credits|credits gain|symbol=no}}.

[[File:Credits1.png|200px|thumb|center]]

