== Features ==
=== Boombox ===

[[File:Boombox.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Boombox]]''
The {{color|rgb(255, 255, 51)|Boombox|black}} is a feature located behind player's spawn that give players access to multiple albums made by the staff team of Upgradex.

=== Cube ===

[[File:Cube.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube]]''
The &lt;span class="gradient" style="background:linear-gradient(#D2CDF0,#F0BEE6)"&gt;'''Cube'''&lt;/span&gt; is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#CB&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It can be clicked, providing boosts and milestones based on the current click amount.

=== Trampoline ===

[[File:Trampoline.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Trampoline]]
The {{Credits|Trampoline|symbol=no}} is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#2B&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It acts as a means of travel that let the player jump to Bonus Baseplate. Another trampoline is located on Bonus Baseplate to go back to the Main Baseplate.

=== Decorator ===

[[File:Decorator.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Decorator]]''
The {{color|rgb(255, 255, 51)|Decorator|black}} is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#3B&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It allows the player buy decorations on every baseplate.

=== Cube Teleporter ===

[[File:CubeTeleporter.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube Teleporter]]
The {{Credits|Cube teleporter|symbol=no}} is a feature unlocked by multiple upgrades. It allows the player to teleport to different zones of the game. This baseplates's Cube Teleporter teleports the player to the [[Donation Baseplate]]

