:''Main article: [[Boombox]]''
The {{Upgrade|Boombox|Yellow}} is a feature located behind player's spawn that give players access to multiple albums made by the staff team of Upgradex.

=== Cube ===

[[File:Cube.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube]]''
The &lt;span class="gradient" style="background:linear-gradient(#D2CDF0,#F0BEE6)"&gt;'''Cube'''&lt;/span&gt; is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#CB&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It can be clicked, providing boosts and milestones based on the current click amount.

=== Trampoline ===

[[File:Trampoline.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Trampoline]]
The {{Credits|Trampoline|symbol=no}} is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#2B&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It acts as a means of travel that let the player jump to the {{Baseplate|Bonus}}. Another trampoline is located on the {{Baseplate|Bonus}} to go back to the {{Baseplate|Bonus}}.

=== Decorator ===

[[File:Decorator.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Decorator]]''
The {{Upgrade|Decorator|Yellow}} is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#3B&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It allows the player buy decorations on every baseplate.

