== Features ==
=== Boombox ===

[[File:Boombox.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Boombox]]''
The {{Upgrade|Yellow|Boombox}} is a feature located behind player's spawn that give players access to multiple albums made by the staff team of Upgradex.

=== Cube ===

[[File:Cube.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube]]''
The &lt;span class="gradient" style="background:linear-gradient(#D2CDF0,#F0BEE6)"&gt;'''Cube'''&lt;/span&gt; is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#CB&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It can be clicked, providing boosts and milestones based on the current click amount.

=== Trampoline ===

[[File:Trampoline.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Trampoline]]
The {{Credits|Trampoline|symbol=no}} is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#2B&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It acts as a means of travel that let the player jump to the {{Baseplate|Bonus}}. Another trampoline is located on the {{Baseplate|Bonus}} to go back to the {{Baseplate|Bonus}}.

=== Decorator ===

[[File:Decorator.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Decorator]]''
The {{Upgrade|Yellow|Decorator}} is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#3B&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It allows the player buy decorations on every baseplate.

=== Cube Teleporter ===

[[File:CubeTeleporter.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube Teleporter]]
The {{Credits|Cube teleporter|symbol=no}} is a feature unlocked by multiple upgrades. It allows the player to teleport to different zones of the game. This baseplates's Cube Teleporter teleports the player to the {{Baseplate|Donation}}

[[Category:Baseplates]]
[[Category:Locations]]

&lt;templatestyles src="Template:Hiddenpage/styles.css" /&gt;
&lt;span class="hidden-pageimage"&gt;[[File:Tp_spawn.png|300px|class=pageimage|link=|alt=]]&lt;/span&gt;

{{Template:Baseplate_infobox|image=File:MainBaseplate.png|previous_baseplate=N/A|next_baseplate=[[Research Baseplate]]&lt;br&gt;[[Donation Baseplate]]}}

The {{Baseplate|Main}} is a [[baseplate]] unlocked upon starting the game. It is the first progression baseplate that players will experience, preceding the {{Baseplate|Research}}. Additionally, the {{Baseplate|Prestige}}, the {{Baseplate|Bonus}} and the {{Baseplate|Donation}} also connect to the baseplate. Currently, the baseplate includes 28 total upgrades: 20 in layer 1 and 8 in layer 2.

== Credits ==

{{Credits|Credits|symbol=no}} ({{Credits}}) is the first currency players unlock. It generates at a base rate of {{Upgrade|Blue|1/s}} upon purchasing {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#1&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} at no cost. Once bought, the upgrade shows the current {{Credits|credits gain|symbol=no}}.

[[File:Credits1.png|200px|thumb|center]]

