The {{Baseplate|Main}} is a [[baseplate]] unlocked upon starting the game. It is the first progression baseplate that players will experience, preceding the {{Baseplate|Research}}. Additionally, the {{Baseplate|Prestige}}, the {{Baseplate|Bonus}} and the {{Baseplate|Donation}} also connect to the baseplate. Currently, the baseplate includes 28 total upgrades: 20 in layer 1 and 8 in layer 2.

== Credits ==
:"We ''credit'' you for playing! Someone please replace this quote."
{{Credits|Credits|symbol=no}} ({{Credits}}) is the first currency players unlock. It generates at a base rate of {{Upgrade|Blue|1/s}} upon purchasing {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#1&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} at no cost. Once bought, the upgrade shows the current {{Credits|credits gain|symbol=no}}.

[[File:Credits1.png|200px|thumb|center]]

