== Features ==
=== Boombox ===

[[File:Boombox.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Boombox]]''
The {{Upgrade|Yellow|Boombox}} is a feature located behind the player's spawn that gives players access to multiple albums made by the staff team of Upgradex. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;

=== Cube ===

[[File:Cube.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube]]''
The &lt;span class="gradient" style="background:linear-gradient(#D2CDF0,#F0BEE6)"&gt;'''Cube'''&lt;/span&gt; is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#CB&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It can be clicked, providing boosts and milestones based on the current click amount. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;

=== Trampoline ===

[[File:Trampoline.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Trampoline]]''
The '''Trampoline''' is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#2B&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It acts as a means of travel that lets the player jump to the {{Baseplate|Bonus}}. Another trampoline is located on the {{Baseplate|Bonus}} to go back to the {{Baseplate|Main}}. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;

=== Decorator ===

[[File:Decorator.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Decorator]]''
The {{Upgrade|Yellow|Decorator}} is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Credits|&lt;nowiki&gt;#3B&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It allows the player to buy decorations on every baseplate. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;

=== Cube Teleporter ===

[[File:CubeTeleporter.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube Teleporter]]''
The '''Cube teleporter''' is a feature unlocked by multiple upgrades. It allows the player to teleport to different zones of the game. This baseplate's Cube Teleporter teleports the player to the {{Baseplate|Donation}}.

