== Features ==
=== Core ===

[[File:TheCore.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Core]]''
The {{Core|Core|symbol=no}} is a feature unlocked alongside {{Energy|Energy|symbol=no}} {{Energy}} after the player purchases Upgrade {{Data|&lt;nowiki&gt;#CR&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} in the Research Baseplate.

=== Computer ===

[[File:Computer.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Computer]]''
The Computer is a feature unlocked by {{Data|&lt;nowiki&gt;#3RB&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} that allows the player play various minigames inside it.

=== Autobuy Settings ===

[[File:AutoBuy Settings.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Autobuy Settings]]''
The Autobuy Settings are a feature unlocked by {{Data|&lt;nowiki&gt;#1A&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} (or {{Data|&lt;nowiki&gt;#1A+&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} for the orange tower) that allow the player to configure unlocked automation settings.

=== Autochallenger ===

[[File:Autochallenger.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Autochallenger]]''
The Autochallenger is a feature unlocked by {{Data|&lt;nowiki&gt;#AC+&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}

[[Category:Baseplates]]
[[Category:Locations]]

{{Stub|The core and other features}}
''"Everyone has to start somewhere!"'' - ASAP 
&lt;templatestyles src="Template:Hiddenpage/styles.css" /&gt;
&lt;span class="hidden-pageimage"&gt;[[File:Tp_data.png|300px|class=pageimage|link=|alt=]]&lt;/span&gt;

{{Template:Baseplate_infobox|image=File:ResearchBaseplate.png|previous_baseplate=[[Main Baseplate]]|next_baseplate=[[Prestige Baseplate]]}}

The &lt;span class="gradient" style="background:linear-gradient(#73d4fe,#5677ce)"&gt;'''Research Baseplate'''&lt;/span&gt; is the second [[baseplate]] unlocked following the [[Main Baseplate|{{Credits|Main Baseplate|symbol=no}}]]. There are currently 28 total upgrades on the Research Baseplate: 16 in layer 1 and 12 on layer 2.

== Data ==

''"tech company simulator (2026)"'' - ASAP &lt;br&gt;
{{Data|Data|symbol=no}} ({{Data}}) is the second main Currency the player unlocks upon performing the Research Baseplate's reset at the RESEARCH Button, which converts at least {{Credits|500}} to {{Data|Data|symbol=no}}.

[[File:Research0.png|200px|thumb|center]]

== Energy ==

''"So this is where the 5 Hour Energy comes from!"'' - ASAP &lt;br&gt;
{{Energy|Energy|symbol=no}} ({{Energy}}) is the third Main Currency unlocked, after {{Data|Data|symbol=no}} and before [[Prestige Baseplate#Prestige|Prestige]]. It's unlocked alongside the [[Core]] upon purchasing Upgrade #CR ("Electric hum"). The player will start gaining the same amount of {{Energy|Energy|symbol=no}} as {{Data|Data|symbol=no}} upon performing a RESEARCH reset.

== Wavelengths ==

'''Wavelengths''' ({{Wavelength}}) are available at the [[Core]] as long as the player has the amount of {{Energy|Energy|symbol=no}} necessary to unlock them. The player has the option to '''focus''' on the desired Wavelength, which will start generating the respective {{Wavelength|white|Wavelength Energy|symbol=no}} {{Wavelength|white}}. Each Wavelength has different '''Milestones''' that will end up providing many useful boosts.

== CXP ==

{{color|rgb(233, 143, 254)|CXP|black}}, or Challenge XP, is unlocked upon purchasing #AC+ (autocom = 2) for {{Data|X}} and is obtained by converting {{Energy|Energy|symbol=no}} into it. It is used to start the next [[Ascension Baseplate|Ascension]] with some challenges already completed based on how much CXP the player had.

