{{Template:Baseplate_infobox|image=File:ResearchBaseplate.png|previous_baseplate={{Baseplate|Main}}|next_baseplate={{Baseplate|Prestige}}}}

The {{Baseplate|Research}} is the second [[baseplate]] unlocked following the {{Baseplate|Main}}. There are currently 28 total upgrades on the {{Baseplate|Research}}: 16 in layer 1 and 12 on layer 2.

== Data ==
:''"tech company simulator (2026)"''
{{Data|Data|symbol=no}} ({{Data}}) is the the player unlocks upon performing the {{Baseplate|Research}}'s reset at the RESEARCH Button, which converts at least {{Credits|500}} to {{Data|Data|symbol=no}} with a formula of +({{Credits}}/500)^0.25.

[[File:Research0.png|200px|thumb|center]]

== Energy ==
:''"So this is where the 5 Hour Energy comes from!"''
{{Energy|Energy|symbol=no}} ({{Energy}}) is the third Main Currency unlocked. It's unlocked alongside the [[Core]] upon purchasing Upgrade #CR ("Electric hum"). The player will start gaining the same amount of {{Energy|Energy|symbol=no}} as {{Data|Data|symbol=no}} upon performing a RESEARCH reset.

== Wavelengths ==

'''Wavelengths''' ({{Wavelength}}) are available at the [[Core]] as long as the player has the amount of {{Energy|Energy|symbol=no}} necessary to unlock them. The player can '''focus''' on those Wavelengths, which will begin the generation of the respective {{Wavelength|white|Wavelength Energy|symbol=no}} ({{Wavelength|white}}). Each Wavelength has certain '''Thresholds''' that gives the player useful boosts upon reaching them.

== CXP ==

{{CXP}} ({{CXP|Challenge XP|symbol=no}}), is unlocked upon purchasing #AC+ (autocom = 2) for {{Upgradecost|#AC+}} and is obtained by {{Energy|Energy|symbol=no}} with a formula of. It allows the player to start the next [[Ascension Baseplate|Ascension]] with challenges already completed. Having more {{CXP}} will result in starting with more challenges at the start of the next {{Ascension|Ascension|symbol=no}}.

