== Features ==
=== Core ===

[[File:TheCore.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Core]]''
The {{Core|Core|symbol=no}} is a feature unlocked alongside {{Energy|Energy|symbol=no}} {{Energy}} after the player purchases Upgrade {{Data|&lt;nowiki&gt;#CR&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} in the {{Baseplate|Research}}.

=== Computer ===

[[File:Computer.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Computer]]''
The Computer is a feature unlocked by {{Data|&lt;nowiki&gt;#3RB&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} that allows the player play various minigames inside it.

=== Autobuy Settings ===

[[File:AutoBuy Settings.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Autobuy Settings]]''
Autobuy Settings is a feature unlocked by {{Data|&lt;nowiki&gt;#1A&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} (or {{Data|&lt;nowiki&gt;#1A+&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}} for the orange tower) that allow the player to configure unlocked automation settings.

=== Autochallenger ===

[[File:Autochallenger.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Autochallenger]]''
The Autochallenger is a feature unlocked by {{Data|&lt;nowiki&gt;#AC+&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}

