{{Template:Baseplate_infobox|image=File:PrestigeBaseplate.png|previous_baseplate=[[Main Baseplate]]|next_baseplate=[[Research Baseplate]]}}


The Prestige Baseplate is the third main [[Baseplate]] unlocked, after the [[Research Baseplate]] and before the (update this in v1.1) Baseplate. It is located to the right of the [[Main Baseplate]]. The Prestige Baseplate includes 15 upgrades and 1 layer as of v1.0.

== Prestige ==
''"Quote." - ASAP''

{{Prestige|Prestige|symbol=no}} ({{Prestige}}) is the fourth main currency unlocked, after [[The Core|Energy]] and before [[Ascension Baseplate|Ascensions]]. It is gained by preforming an Ascension Reset.

