The {{Baseplate|Prestige}} is the third main [[Baseplate]] unlocked, after the {{Baseplate|Research}} and before the {{Baseplate|Ascension}}. It is located to the right of the {{Baseplate|Main}}. The {{Baseplate|Prestige}} includes 23 upgrades and 2 layers as of v1.1.

