== Features ==

=== Pyramid ===
:''Main article: [[Pyramid]]''
The [[Pyramid]] is a structure located at the back of the {{Baseplate|Prestige}} and is unlocked by purchasing {{Prestige|&lt;nowiki&gt;#PYR (CHALLENGERS)&lt;/nowiki&gt;|symbol=no}}. It gives the player access to challenges - a fundamental upgrade tree feature.

