The '''Bonus Baseplate''' is unlocked through purchasing #2B, and is the fourth baseplate to be unlocked (preceded by the [[Main Baseplate]], [[Donation Baseplate]], and [[Research Baseplate]] in that order) and the second non-main progression baseplate (preceded by the [[Donation Baseplate]])

== Alpha ==

{{Alpha|Alpha|symbol=no}} ({{Alpha}}) is the third bonus currency (preceded by fuel and cash in that order) and the fifth currency the player will unlock (preceded by credits, fuel, cash, and data in that order). It can be obtained by clicking on #1α, giving you 1 {{Alpha}} per click, with a cooldown of 3 seconds.

== Studs ==
{{Studs|Studs|symbol=no}} are the fourth bonus currency that the player will unlock. It is obtained by purchasing #1αb (The stud tower) which gives you 1 stud per upgrade, alternatively you can buy the BUY MAX upgrade do the left of #1αb to buy all of the {{Studs|Studs|symbol=no}} you're able to at that moment.

== Beta ==

{{Beta|Beta|symbol=no}} ({{Beta}}) is the fifth bonus currency that the player will unlock. It is obtained by unlocking layer 2 of the Bonus Baseplate with #7αb (2025) and then resetting all of your {{Alpha|Alpha|symbol=no}} and {{Studs|Studs|symbol=no}} and converting them to {{Beta|Beta|symbol=no}} with #1β (Sigma pay) on layer 2.

