== Features ==

=== The Mastery ===

:''Main article [[The Mastery]]''
The Mastery is unlocked with #1Ω

=== Jerry ===

:''Main article: [[Jerry]]''
Jerry is an npc, they say the quote and other stuff. They are unlocked with #2Ω (Move to gallery)

=== The Stud ===

:''Main article: [[The Stud]]''
The Stud is a tower that can be grown one stud at a time by purchasing #1αb (The stud tower) up to 65,536 studs tall.

=== Void hole ===

find out name
Teleports the player to [[Nowhere]] (Move to gallery)

=== Trampoline ===

[[File:Trampoline.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Trampoline]]
The Trampoline is a feature unlocked by upgrade #2B. It acts as a mean of travel that let the player jump to Bonus Baseplate. Another trampoline is located on Bonus Baseplate to go back to Main Baseplate. The one on this baseplate is yellow with an outline of a yellow star on the bouncy part.

=== Cube Teleporter ===

[[File:CubeTeleporter.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube Telepoter]]''
The Cube teleporter is a feature unlocked by multiple upgrades. It allows the player to teleport to different zones of the game.

