== Alpha ==

{{Alpha|Alpha|symbol=no}} ({{Alpha}}) is an alternate currency that can be obtained by purchasing #1α (Erzeugen), giving 1 {{Alpha}} per click, with a cooldown of 3 seconds.

== Studs ==
{{Studs|Studs|symbol=no}} are an alternate currency that can be obtained by purchasing #1αb (The Stud Tower) which gives 1 stud per upgrade, alternatively the player can buy the BUY MAX upgrade to the left of #1αb to buy max the upgrade.

== Beta ==

{{Beta|Beta|symbol=no}} ({{Beta}}) is an alternate currency unlocked after reaching layer 2 of the Bonus Baseplate with #7αb (2025). It is obtained by buying #1β (Sigma pay) on layer 2, in turn reset most {{Tags|Alpha}} upgrades and convert {{Alpha|Alpha|symbol=no}} and {{Studs|Studs|symbol=no}} to {{Beta|Beta|symbol=no}}.

