== Features ==

=== The Mastery ===

:''Main article [[The Mastery]]''
The Mastery is unlocked with #1Ω

=== Jerry ===

[[File:Jerry.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Jerry]]''
Jerry is an npc, they say the quote and other stuff. They are unlocked with #2Ω (Move to gallery)

=== The Stud ===

:''Main article: [[The Stud]]''
The Stud is a tower that can be grown one stud at a time by purchasing #1αb (The stud tower) up to 65,536 studs tall.

