[[File:The_Gateway.png|200px|thumb|right]]
Teleports the player to [[The Void]]
&lt;!--&gt;(Move to gallery)&lt;--&gt;

=== Trampoline ===

[[File:Trampoline.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Trampoline]]
The Trampoline is a feature unlocked by upgrade #2B. It acts as a means of travel that lets the player jump to and from the Bonus Baseplate. Another trampoline is located on the Bonus Baseplate to go back to the Main Baseplate. The one on this baseplate is yellow with an outline of a yellow star on the bouncy part.

=== Cube Teleporter ===

[[File:CubeTeleporter.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Cube Telepoter]]''
The Cube teleporter is a feature unlocked by multiple upgrades. It allows the player to teleport to different zones of the game.

