== History ==
=== v1.0 ===
* There used to be a Buymax upgrade next to {{Upgrade|#1αb|NJUT}} (The stud tower) to buy max the upgrade. It got removed in 1.1 because it was causing {{Upgrade|#1αb|NJUT}} automation to not work correctly.

== Trivia ==
* Before release, the {{Baseplate|Bonus}} underwent many design and color changes, like green, yellow, blue(?), red and even yellow again then back to green. It also used to be ocean-themed.
* There used to be a mechanic where the player had to change their display name to what was according to the list, and it would boost their credits gain in some way. However, it was scrapped because:
** ''"The idea was just stupid"'' 
** It broke the rule of Bonus progression not influencing Main progression.

