== Alpha ==

{{Alpha|Alpha|symbol=no}} ({{Alpha}}) is a currency that can be obtained by purchasing #1α (Erzeugen), giving 1 {{Alpha}} per click, with a cooldown of 3 seconds. 

[[File:alpha1.png|200px|thumb|center]]

== Studs ==
{{Studs|Studs|symbol=no}} are obtained by purchasing #1αb (The Stud Tower) which gives 1 stud every upgrade level. {{Studs|Studs|symbol=no}} acts as a currency for the player to buy most upgrades with {{Tag|Upgrade|NJUT}} tags

[[File:studs1.png|200px|thumb|center]]

== Beta ==

{{Beta|Beta|symbol=no}} ({{Beta}}) is a currency unlocked after reaching layer 2 of the {{Baseplate|Bonus}} with #7αb (2025). It is obtained by buying #1β (Sigma pay) on layer 2, in turn reset most {{Tag|Upgrade|Alpha}} upgrades and convert {{Alpha|Alpha|symbol=no}} and {{Studs|Studs|symbol=no}} to {{Beta|Beta|symbol=no}}.

[[File:beta1.png|200px|thumb|center]]

