[[File:The_Gateway.png|200px|thumb|right]]
Teleports the player to [[The Void]] upon falling into it. It is located to the right of the yellow trampoline. 

=== Trampoline ===

[[File:Trampoline.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[Trampoline]]
The Trampoline is a feature unlocked by upgrade {{Upgrade|Yellow|#2B}}. It acts as a means of travel that lets the player jump to and from the {{Baseplate|Bonus}}. Another trampoline is located on the {{Baseplate|Bonus}} to go back to the {{Baseplate|Main}}. The one on this baseplate is yellow with a hollow yellow star on the jump mat.

