The '''Donation Baseplate''' is a [[baseplate]] unlocked by purchasing #D in the [[Main Baseplate]]. It is optional and does not contribute to any progression outside of the baseplate. Currently, the Donation Baseplate includes 13 upgrades.

== Currencies ==
=== Cash ===

{{Cash|Cash|symbol=no}} ({{Cash}}) is the main currency used for upgrades in the baseplate. It generates at a base rate of +{{Cash|1}}/s at the cost of -{{Fuel|1}}/s.

=== Fuel ===

{{Fuel|Fuel|symbol=no}} ({{Fuel}}) is the currency required to generate {{Cash|Cash|symbol=no}}. It can be obtained by either donating robux or claiming #DNb every 23 hours (Reduces to 12 hours for donators).

==Ice cube==
The Ice cube slows down the reduction of {{Fuel|Fuel|symbol=no}}, while also slowing down production of {{Cash|Cash|symbol=no}}, in order to give more time to the player to think. It does not boost or hinder {{Cash|Cash|symbol=no}} gain.
