== Features ==
=== Daily rewards ===

Daily reward (#DNb) features a streak mechanic where the player buy the upgrades daily to increase the streak indicated by the fire icon next to the upgrade. The streak combo increments by 1 each time the upgrade is bought. Failing to buy the upgrade again within 48 hours will result in the streak resetting to zero and the fire icon will turn gray. #DNb is free, however it has a 12 hour cooldown after each purchase. Buying #DNb rewards {{Fuel|Fuel|symbol=no}} based on [[Achievements|Achivement Rating (AR)]].

Additionally, the streak can be used to purchase #-s$ Upgrades. Those upgrade don't spend the player's streak, however.
=== Ice cube ===

The {{Upgrade|Ice|Ice cube}} is unlocked after purchasing #1c$. It can slow down or speed up the consumption of {{Fuel|Fuel|symbol=no}}, in turn also changes the speed of {{Cash|Cash|symbol=no}} production. It is often utilized to give more time for players to think. It does not boost nor hinder {{Cash|Cash|symbol=no}} gain in any way.

The {{Upgrade|Ice|Ice cube}} can change the speed of {{Fuel|Fuel|symbol=no}} consumption between the range of {{Upgrade|Ice|-80%}} to {{Upgrade|Ice|+80%}}. The upper range can be increased up to {{Upgrade|Ice|+180%}} by upgrading 
=== Nuclear plant ===

The {{Nuclear Energy|Nuclear plant|symbol=no}} is unlocked after purchasing #3c$. It generates {{Nuclear Energy|Nuclear Energy|symbol=no}} based on main progression. The formula for generating {{Nuclear Energy|Nuclear Energy|symbol=no}} is ({{Credits|Credits|symbol=no}} * {{Data|Data|symbol=no}} * {{Prestige|Prestige|symbol=no}})^0.025. 

