'''Nowhere''' is a [[location]] whose entrance can be found on the [[Bonus Baseplate]].

== Void ==

{{Void|Void|symbol=no}} ({{Void}}) is the 4th Bonus currency listed on the statistics tab, it is obtained by finding the void and purchasing #-1 (Manifestation) which starts generating {{Void|Void|symbol=no}} at a base rate of +{{Void|1}}/s.

== Yen ==

{{Yen|Yen|symbol=no}} ({{Yen}}) is the 5th Bonus currency listed on the statistics tab, it is obtained by activating the [[Nowhere|RNG Machine]] (Unlocked with #RM (Highroll)) and activating the lever on the side. Once the lever is activated, the player will roll an [[Nowhere|Aura]], and get {{Yen|Yen|symbol=no}} depending on the rarity.

