{{Baseplate|Void}} is a [[location]] that can be accessed upon entering the [[Gateway]] which is located on the {{Baseplate|Bonus}}.


== Void ==
{{Void|Void|symbol=no}} ({{Void}}) is a currency obtained by purchasing #-1 (Manifestation) which starts generating {{Void|Void|symbol=no}} at a base rate of +{{Void|1}}/s.

[[File:Void1.png|200px|thumb|center]]

== Yen ==
{{Yen|Yen|symbol=no}} ({{Yen}}) is a currency obtained by playing the [[RNG Machine]] (Unlocked with #RM (Highroll)) and activating the lever on the side. Once the lever is activated, the player will roll an [[RNG Machine#Auras|Aura]], and get {{Yen|Yen|symbol=no}} depending on the rarity of the aura rolled.

== Dark Matter  ==
{{Dark Matter|Dark Matter|symbol=no}} ({{Dark Matter}}) is a currency obtained by resetting {{Void}} progress and turning it into {{Dark Matter}}. It is unlocked by purchasing upgrade #-20 (Layer 3), which unlocks the third layer in {{Baseplate|Void}}.

[[File:Darkmatter1.png|200px|thumb|center]]

