== Features ==

=== RNG Machine ===

[[File:RNGMachine.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[RNG Machine]]''
The RNG Machine is unlocked after purchasing '''#RM''' (Highroll). It is used to roll for [[RNG Machine#Auras|Auras]] rewarding {{Yen|Yen|symbol=no}} based on the aura's rarity. Auras are also used to purchase '''#[]AU''' upgrades.


=== z ===


[[File:z.png|200px|thumb|right]]
:''Main article: [[z]]''
Z is a zero-gravity cube that accessorizes with a halo. Their body holds a color-inverted view of the world from looking through it.

