== Usage ==

&lt;pre&gt;
{{EntryDetail
|key=cod
|image=Cod.png
|name=Cod
|rarity=Common
|back=items-fish
|chance=Fish Island: 27.1068%&lt;br&gt;Bonus: 37.5%
|sell=TBD
|lore=MMM I love cod
}}
&lt;/pre&gt;

== Parameters ==

; key
: Unique lowercase ID used by the Entries JavaScript.

; image
: File name of the entry image.

; name
: Display name of the entry.

; rarity
: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Legendary, or Mythic.

; chance
: Catch chance. This appears beneath the rarity.

; sell
: Fish sell value. This appears at the bottom-left of the detail page.

; back
: Page to return to when the Back button is pressed.

; lore
: Description or effect information.

&lt;/noinclude&gt;

